  "description": "RUMVON crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C36 H80 N11 O34 Yb6 1+,2(C1 H4 O1),2(C1 H2 Cl2),N1 O3 1-. From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Yb5 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Yb6 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.597-3.688 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 106.25-111.74°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Yb6(teaH)6(NO3)5(H2O)]·(NO3)(CH2Cl2)2(MeOH)2. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 5 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
